  {"id":57,"x":180,"y":260,"z":0,"title":"Abandoned Mine, Stony Labyrinth","descriptions":["It is difficult to keep a sense of direction in this stony labyrinth.  Chambers and tunnels open up in every conceivable direction.  The eerie silence is broken only by the crunch of rocks and crystals underfoot."],"exits":[{"to":58,"exit":"north","move":"north","hidden":true},{"to":58,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast","hidden":true},{"to":58,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast","hidden":true},{"to":58,"exit":"east","move":"east","hidden":true},{"to":54,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":58,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest","hidden":true},{"to":58,"exit":"west","move":"west","hidden":true},{"to":60,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}],"color":"#FFBF00"},
  {"id":58,"x":100,"y":260,"z":0,"title":"Abandoned Mine, Stony Labyrinth","descriptions":["It is difficult to keep a sense of direction in this stony labyrinth.  Chambers and tunnels open up in every conceivable direction.  The eerie silence is broken only by the crunch of rocks and crystals underfoot."],"exits":[{"to":59,"exit":"north","move":"north","hidden":true},{"to":59,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast","hidden":true},{"to":59,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast","hidden":true},{"to":59,"exit":"east","move":"east","hidden":true},{"to":59,"exit":"south","move":"south","hidden":true},{"to":59,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest","hidden":true},{"to":59,"exit":"west","move":"west","hidden":true},{"to":59,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest","hidden":true}],"color":"#FFBF00"},
  {"id":59,"x":140,"y":260,"z":0,"title":"Abandoned Mine, Stony Labyrinth","descriptions":["It is difficult to keep a sense of direction in this stony labyrinth.  Chambers and tunnels open up in every conceivable direction.  The eerie silence is broken only by the crunch of rocks and crystals underfoot."],"exits":[{"to":57,"exit":"north","move":"north","hidden":true},{"to":57,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast","hidden":true},{"to":57,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast","hidden":true},{"to":57,"exit":"east","move":"east","hidden":true},{"to":57,"exit":"south","move":"south","hidden":true},{"to":57,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest","hidden":true},{"to":57,"exit":"west","move":"west","hidden":true},{"to":57,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest","hidden":true}],"color":"#FFBF00"},
  {"id":60,"x":140,"y":220,"z":0,"title":"Abandoned Mine, Bone Room","descriptions":["Debris and bones are strewn all over the floor.  Some appear to be more recent additions to the collection, while others are covered in an hardened layer of calcite.  A distinct dampness has filled the air, the walls glisten and the way underfoot has become slightly treacherous.  To the south are three identical-looking tunnels."],"exits":[{"to":59,"exit":"south","move":"south","hidden":true},{"to":57,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":58,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest","hidden":true},{"to":61,"exit":"go","move":"go crawlway"}],"color":"#FFBF00"},
  {"id":61,"x":140,"y":200,"z":0,"title":"Abandoned Mine, Crawlway","descriptions":["You manage to squeeze through a crawlway, following the course of trickling water.  Beautiful dripstones suddenly appear, the younger ones a glistening white color, the older and larger ones colored yellow and brown.  Neatly arranged in a row, several stalactites hang from the ceiling in single file.  The far wall has an unnatural quality to it."],"exits":[{"to":46,"exit":"go","move":"go far wall"},{"to":60,"exit":"go","move":"go crawlway"}]},
  {"id":62,"x":260,"y":400,"z":1,"title":"Lairocott Brach, Lairorung","descriptions":["Carefully chiseled into the floor within the circle of stones is the hallowed image of Kertigen.  Unlike other areas of the dwarven settlement, where some of the floors have become worn and smooth with age, the surface here appears unchanged from its original state."],"exits":[{"to":13,"exit":"out","move":"out"},{"to":63,"exit":"go","move":"go deep oeblichar"}]},
  {"id":63,"x":300,"y":340,"z":1,"title":"Lairocott Brach, Oeblichar","descriptions":["This large, round chamber is dimly lit by four sets of torches that have been spaced in cardinal locations around the room.  Oddly, while the flames of the torches do flicker, they do not burn down.  Whether this is due to some strange and unknown temporal magic or the power of something far greater than mortal ken is hard to ascertain.  Gypsum and minerals glitter from within their prisons in the smooth stone, and the floor is carved with a complex circular knotwork pattern."],"exits":[{"to":80,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":96,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":81,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":64,"exit":"north","move":"north"}]},
  {"id":64,"x":300,"y":300,"z":1,"title":"Lairocott Brach, Hrachnar","descriptions":["The blank, dark gray walls are smooth and seamless, the doorways flowing out of the stone like natural structures.  Four torches line the walls, each set at the cardinal points of northeast, west, east, and south.  The floor is a glossy black amber, reflecting the light and throwing it back in your eyes, dancing with a dizzying and unnatural shine."],"exits":[{"to":65,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":82,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":63,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":83,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":65,"x":340,"y":260,"z":1,"title":"Lairocott Brach, Hrachnar","descriptions":["The blank, dark gray walls are smooth and seamless, the doorways flowing out of the stone like natural structures.  Light filters in from the passages, fitfully illuminating the knotwork pattern in the floor.  Somewhere, the dripping of water echoes through the twisting tunnels of the cavern."],"exits":[{"to":85,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":84,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":64,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":66,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":66,"x":300,"y":260,"z":1,"title":"Lairocott Brach, Hrachnar","descriptions":["The blank, dark gray walls are smooth and seamless, the doorways flowing out of the stone like natural structures.  Four torches line the walls, each set at the cardinal points of northwest, southwest, east, and south.  The floor is a glossy black amber, reflecting the light and throwing it back in your eyes, dancing with a dizzying and unnatural shine."],"exits":[{"to":65,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":87,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":86,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":67,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
