  {"id":78,"x":200,"y":100,"z":1,"title":"Lairocott Brach, Hrachnar","descriptions":["The blank, dark gray walls are smooth and seamless, the doorways flowing out of the stone like natural structures.  Four torches line the walls, each set at the cardinal points of southwest, northeast, northwest, and east.  The floor is a glossy black amber, reflecting the light and throwing it back in your eyes, dancing with a dizzying and unnatural shine."],"exits":[{"to":109,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":77,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":79,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":110,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":79,"x":80,"y":220,"z":1,"title":"Lairocott Brach, Lairorung Solsteen","descriptions":["The blank, dark gray walls are smooth and seamless, with one single doorway flowing out of the northeast wall.  The light is dim, and the strong, warm presence of something otherworldly fills the chamber.  A small altar rests against the west wall, looking as if it were shaped from the living stone."],"exits":[{"to":78,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":62,"exit":"none","move":"pray"}],"color":"#A6A3D9","aliases":["Shrine","Lairorung Solsteen"]},
  {"id":80,"x":320,"y":340,"z":1,"title":"Lairocott Brach, Eklan","descriptions":["This recessed alcove is shaped like a half-square, its stark wall halting all further progress through the twisting caverns."],"exits":[{"to":63,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
