  {"id":111,"x":340,"y":120,"z":0,"title":"Lairocott Brach, Forkbeard's Brodger","descriptions":["This hall is distinguished by a large table and two stone benches that run the length of the tavern.  At the far end of the hall is a large roaring fire, the smoke slowly curling up towards the hole in the ceiling.  Along the walls are hung various furs, skins and mining implements.  Hakon Forkbeard is standing behind the imposing marble-topped bar, working and whispering intently to several of his customers."],"exits":[{"to":5,"exit":"go","move":"go tavern doors"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Forkbeard's Brodger","food","drink"]},
  {"id":112,"x":240,"y":60,"z":0,"title":"Lairocott Brach, Muckele's Hoy","descriptions":["Heat, noise and the smell of sweat assail your senses as you enter this busy workshop.  Hung on one of the walls is an ornate suit of armor, several pick axes, sturdy helmets and other mining accessories.  Muckele Rognvald stands at the forge, fashioning yet another suit of armor."],"exits":[{"to":15,"exit":"go","move":"go thick door"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Muckele's Hoy","Armor","Weapons"]},
  {"id":113,"x":300,"y":120,"z":0,"title":"Lairocott Brach, Freel Brach","descriptions":["A thick layer of dust lies on the floor.  This hut awaits a new occupant."],"exits":[{"to":16,"exit":"go","move":"go arched doorway"}]},
  {"id":114,"x":340,"y":-20,"z":0,"title":"Felen Ulak, The Gate","descriptions":["Hastily worked walls surround this impromptu foyer, jagged stones and thin veins of metal casting an odd mesh of light and shadow.  A blackened steel gate spans the width of the chamber, blocking all attempts to progress deeper into the cave."],"exits":[{"to":115,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":11,"exit":"go","move":"go dark crevice"}],"aliases":["Felen Ulak"]},
  {"id":115,"x":360,"y":-20,"z":0,"title":"Felen Ulak, A Jagged Room","descriptions":["Jagged walls draw uncomfortably close in this diminutive space, rivulets of dense shadow coursing through their cracked surfaces.  A discarded anvil sits slightly askew on the uneven floor, the glossy black of its surface muted by several dark red stains."],"exits":[{"to":114,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":116,"x":260,"y":140,"z":0,"title":"Foothills, Stony Incline","descriptions":["Taking the opportunity to examine the distant countryside, large green forests in the southwest, flatlands to the south and the large ocean expanse to the southeast all catch the eye.  All seem more attractive than the forbidding set of cliffs up ahead."],"exits":[{"to":1,"exit":"up","move":"up"}],"aliases":["Northern Trade Road","NTR"],"linksTo":"Map7_NTR.xml"},
  {"id":117,"x":180,"y":180,"z":0,"title":"Abandoned Mine, Collapsed Tunnel","descriptions":["The narrow passage is cramped in places where rotted beams that once supported the mine have collapsed.  A perpetual cloud of dust hangs in the air, making it difficult to see more than a few paces away in any direction.  A small opening to the west allows passage back to the main tunnel."],"exits":[{"to":118,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":121,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":47,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"color":"#FF8000"},
  {"id":118,"x":195,"y":165,"z":0,"title":"Abandoned Mine, Pit","descriptions":["A noxious, sulphurous odor clings to the air, threatening to overwhelm the senses.  Yellow-green pockets of the gas linger near the pit, though exactly what they are or where they come from is unclear.  Falling away into the abyss is a length of rope with rusty red discolorations marring the frayed knots that secure it topside."],"exits":[{"to":119,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":121,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":117,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}],"color":"#FF8000"},
  {"id":119,"x":225,"y":165,"z":0,"title":"Abandoned Mine, Pit","descriptions":["Discarded piles of tools litter the area.  The rusted heads of mining picks are lodged into the stone walls where their workers last struck, and no sign of their handles remain.  Wheelbarrows are upturned, their glittering prizes strewn about as if a child flung sand."],"exits":[{"to":120,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":121,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":118,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"color":"#FF8000"},
  {"id":120,"x":240,"y":180,"z":0,"title":"Abandoned Mine, Pit","descriptions":["Three rocky mounds reside near the cavern's fall wall.  Atop each rests a mining pick and the rotted remains of cloth or leather gloves.  A message is scratched crudely into the floor in a circle surrounding the graves."],"exits":[{"to":121,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":119,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}],"color":"#FF8000"},
  {"id":121,"x":210,"y":180,"z":0,"title":"Abandoned Mine, Pit","descriptions":["A vast hole plunges into a dark abyss.  Grooves the size of a horse are slashed into the rocky ground ringing the pit, and toppled stanchions still clinging to broken lengths of chain are scattered about.  Rhythmic dripping can be heard somewhere nearby, though its source is concealed."],"exits":[{"to":119,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":120,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":117,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":118,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}],"color":"#FF8000"}
 ],
